OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GThis week's Trunk of Funk comes
OL,7,     Gfrom DJ and producer Umbo, a long-
OL,8,     Gtime figure in the modern funk
OL,9,     Gand breaks scene.
OL,10,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,11,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,12,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,13,     Gweek, his record box contains
OL,14,     GBlack Samurai, James Blake,
OL,15,     GSuzanne Vega, Fauna and Skip
OL,16,     GMarley amongst others.
